# An OpenCode chat's model picker, the models its earlier chats started on above the full list.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
signed-in
project storefront shop
chat Scout opencode opencode/nemotron-3.5-super-vl-free
chat Tally opencode opencode/deepseek-v4.1-flash-free
chat Pike opencode opencode/big-pickle
